      "hidden": false,
      "parentId": null,
      "inheritedFrom": null,
      "kind": "shape",
      "text": "\nBusiness Strategies and their alignment with Risk Appetite are reviewed/challenged by GRM Senior Management as part of the Bank’s Annual Planning Cycle. \nClear KPI Metrics: Second line has established metrics for monitoring the Bank’s execution against it strategic, financial, and capital plans, which feed into it’s view of the Bank’s Strategic Risk Profile. \nRisk Appetite: As of Q1/26, Strategic Risk profile remains within appetite, with risk appetite metrics within thresholds.\nStrategic Risk is assessed as Moderate High (Residual) driven by external geopolitical events (conflicts, trade barriers) and resulting macro-economic uncertainties. \n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "placeholder": null,
